326
00:25:08,009 --> 00:25:09,029
How you doing, Leonard?

327
00:25:09,840 --> 00:25:11,239
Probably in the room, right?

328
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:32,959
-I don't see my key anywhere. -This is the wrong room.

329
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:35,330
-You're in 304 now. -I'm sorry. I fucked up.

330
00:25:35,740 --> 00:25:37,029
