333
00:25:40,009 --> 00:25:41,739
剃左腿

334
00:25:45,280 --> 00:25:47,939
This was your room, but now you're in 304.

335
00:25:48,250 --> 00:25:49,939
-When was I in here? -Last week.

336
00:25:50,350 --> 00:25:52,550
But then I rented you another room on top of it.

337
00:25:52,850 --> 00:25:53,479
Why?

338
00:25:53,790 --> 00:25:57,019
Business is slow. I mean, I told my boss about the...

339
00:25:57,320 --> 00:25:59,710
