340
00:26:00,059 --> 00:26:02,259
So how many rooms am I checked into in this shit-hole?

341
00:26:02,530 --> 00:26:04,489
Just two, so far.

342
00:26:05,069 --> 00:26:08,419
Well, at least you're being honest about ripping me off.

343
00:26:08,770 --> 00:26:10,569
Well, you're not gonna remember anyway.

344
00:26:11,410 --> 00:26:12,670
You don't have to be that honest, Burt.

345
00:26:13,270 --> 00:26:13,999
Leonard,

346
00:26:14,640 --> 00:26:16,439
always get a receipt.

347
00:26:17,310 --> 00:26:18,899
Oh, yeah. I'm gonna write that down.

348
