402
00:29:06,510 --> 00:29:09,680
Oh, shit. Shit! I got to be someplace.

403
00:29:14,919 --> 00:29:15,979
It's pretty weird.

404
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:20,389
It's useful. You never write a phone number on your hand?

405
00:29:20,660 --> 00:29:21,419
I, um...

406
