1307
01:38:32,299 --> 01:38:35,459
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Wait, wait, wait. Did he tell you what I was bringing?

1308
01:38:35,569 --> 01:38:36,558
Take your fuckin' pants off!

1309
01:38:36,699 --> 01:38:39,668
