1365
01:42:50,159 --> 01:42:51,519
The insulin.

1366
01:42:52,890 --> 01:42:55,559
That's Sammy, not me. I told you about Sammy.

1367
01:42:55,830 --> 01:42:58,749
Yeah, right. Like you tell yourself over and over again.

1368
01:42:59,069 --> 01:43:00,619
Conditioning yourself to remember.

1369
01:43:00,929 --> 01:43:02,129
Learning through repetition.

1370
